      "body": "Preheat oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">325 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(163 °C)</span></span>, racks upper- and lower-middle. Scoop ≈40 g balls onto the lined sheets, 6–8 per sheet. Tear each in half and press back together, rough sides out."
